  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "SnakeYaml had a CVE come out on March 20, 2023. That is a transitive dependency of our through jackson-databind-yaml. Jackson has stated that this is not acutally a problem, but due to all the automated checks, they are going to do a release. We should update to that version when it is released.",
       "type": "text"
      }
